@PersonalBlogServer_HostAddress = http://localhost:5148

### 1. Test Landing Page
GET {{PersonalBlogServer_HostAddress}}/api/public/landing
Accept: application/json

### 2. Test About Page
GET {{PersonalBlogServer_HostAddress}}/api/public/about
Accept: application/json

### 3. Test All Topics (Danh sách chủ đề)
GET {{PersonalBlogServer_HostAddress}}/api/public/topics
Accept: application/json

### 4. Test All Topics with Search
GET {{PersonalBlogServer_HostAddress}}/api/public/topics?search=vue
Accept: application/json

### 5. Test Topic Detail (Chi tiết 1 chủ đề)
# Thay 'vue-js' bằng slug thực tế có trong database của bạn
GET {{PersonalBlogServer_HostAddress}}/api/public/topics/vue-js?page=1&pageSize=6&sortBy=latest
Accept: application/json

### 6. Test Topic Detail with Search / Tag
GET {{PersonalBlogServer_HostAddress}}/api/public/topics/vue-js?page=1&pageSize=6&sortBy=popular&search=router
Accept: application/json
